<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 24/25.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on</p>
<p>Thursday set the following currency fixings for July 25. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   25.07.97	  24.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6892	    6.7220</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1899	    2.1939</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3358	    4.3450</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4532	    3.4646</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5104	    0.5114</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7443	    0.7440</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2738	    0.2742</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9114	    6.9216</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6905	    0.6905</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1603	    1.1641</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
